[{"title":"南浦 题龙岩湖上斋舲图","author":"黄燮清","text":"两堤晴翠，载琴书、闲访白鸥邻。\n睡起青山一笑，如待冶游人。\n难得承平年少，便文章、诗酒也精神。\n借微波写梦，斜阳绘影，高卧枕溪云。\n弹指匆匆桑海，恁西来、鼙鼓动边尘。\n剩有蘼芜怨绿，冷画战场春。\n我欲登临凭吊，怕楼台、花月总销魂。\n问湖桥细柳，啼烟泣雨，何日解眉颦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39206,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"满江红 题施庭午茂才杞忧草","author":"黄燮清","text":"半壁江山，问谁救、生灵焚溺。\n叹当局，议防议战，总无全策。\n徵调可怜财赋尽，流离但觉乾坤仄。\n十馀年、格斗未曾休，翻多贼。\n军糈匮，还侵蚀。\n兵士悍，争剽劫。\n任东南千里，纵横狼猰。\n杜牧罪言何处上，贾生热泪从旁滴。\n借书生，歌哭叩苍生，天应恻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39207,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"高阳台 孙欢伯大令寿，以其先人子和先生义钧所绘吴门清荫禅院延秋雅集图遗卷索题","author":"黄燮清","text":"借酒寻欢，携筇选胜，烟波自结鸥盟。\n梵宇尘空，苔痕略扫闲庭。\n疏华点染清凉界，悟时禅，鼻观香生。\n好光阴。\n文宴流连，想像承平。\n而今莫说南朝寺，叹江山半壁，地棘天荆。\n耆旧风流，惟馀劫后丹青。\n苏台鹿走无人问，怕伤时、佛泪先零。\n任萧萧，万叶梧桐，做尽秋声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39208,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"齐天乐 题龙岩临清杀贼图，咸丰甲寅三月初七夜事","author":"黄燮清","text":"蔡州风雪昆仑月，奇功半由昏夜。\n闲道衔枚，乘虚破竹，旂鼓真从天下。\n纵横阵马。\n剩百骑穿营，锦帆兴霸。\n力洗妖腥，大河奔浪势倾泻。\n东南数年格斗，劫灰犹未净，搔首嗟讶。\n白骨云屯，黄金土掷，安得江山清暇。\n公真健者。\n使十万么么，望尘惊怕。\n特将纷纷，战勋谁继也。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39209,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"高阳台 高次愚上舍索题梅窗读书图，时越中不守，杭城被围","author":"黄燮清","text":"玉碎疏帘，茶温小阁，东风才逗横枝。\n雪海无尘，生绡雅称题诗。\n香吹纸墨人俱韵，赋游仙、高卧偏宜。\n但依依。\n梦里江南，费尽相思。\n吴山越水登临地，叹画中泉石，虏骑纷驰。\n粉本倪黄，可怜风景都非。\n伤心世界君休问，看烟云、起灭移时。\n怕迟迟。\n春到孤山，鹤瘦难支。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39210,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"惜余春慢","author":"黄燮清","text":"傅粉临妆，凝脂扶醉，上巳初晴时序。\n嫣然欲笑，澹不胜情，如对玉人三五。\n曾记愔愔画廊，把酒看伊，燕憎莺妒。\n怕匆匆开落，传神摹艳，要春留住。\n谁信道、愁入芙蓉，芒生荆棘，一霎催花风雨。\n楼台泡影，翰墨沧桑，忍忆那回尊俎。\n不是天台梦游，自出山来，恁时归去。\n问仙源鸡犬，总难忘却，画图重补。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39211,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"高阳台 苏小小像，为如冠久观察题","author":"黄燮清","text":"笑颊红欹，娟眉黛远，天然画里真真。\n艳迹依稀，难忘油碧车尘。\n东风蝴蝶怜芳草，尚思量、往日罗裙。\n断桥边，楚楚垂杨，可是前身。\n旧游每忆西泠路，访埋香小冢，一奠清尊。\n我辈情多，悠悠隔世伤神。\n落花满地沧桑泪，料蘼芜、也化愁根。\n待何时，劫尽春回，重与招魂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39212,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"声声慢 题姜晓泉埙听秋仕女图","author":"黄燮清","text":"露滴松钗，烟苏石发，深深庭院良宵。\n有约吟秋，婵娟大小双乔。\n妆楼乍过新雁，语西风、罗带凉飘。\n虚籁警，正蛩帘梦坠，麝炷心焦。\n还问声来何处，恁无情偏感，似醉难销。\n人自工愁，非关梧叶芭蕉。\n冰丝夜长慢理，借商音、闲谱离骚。\n幽思远，望青天、银汉影高。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39213,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"减兰 其一","author":"黄燮清","text":"画楼西畔。\n一径苔痕都立断。\n悄隔红窗。\n却教鹦哥骂玉郎。\n桃根姊妹。\n几点眉山烟外翠。\n瑟瑟宫花。\n掩映秋蝉两翅纱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39214,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"减兰 其二","author":"黄燮清","text":"晚妆才了。\n粉气如烟空处绕。\n携手斜阳。\n鬓后风味渐渐香。\n偷移宝屧。\n便不逢人心已怯。\n小语多时。\n只有花阴宿鸟知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39215,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"减兰 其三","author":"黄燮清","text":"木樨花发。\n记向花边寻宿约。\n挨近罗衣。\n替掠烟鬟未整丝。\n黄昏归路。\n辨不分明烟外树。\n澹月疏帘。\n一丈桐阴绿到檐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39216,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"减兰 其四","author":"黄燮清","text":"扁舟西去。\n两地情怀无说处。\n各自生愁。\n各自昏昏过一秋。\n寒灯谁共。\n枕上定须寻好梦。\n梦若寻来。\n夜半楼扉为我开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39217,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子 其一","author":"黄燮清","text":"玲珑亭子分三面，一面迥廊。\n一面红墙。\n一面栏干靠夕阳。\n木樨香和茶烟腻，才出纱窗。\n才整罗棠。\n人倚西风语亦凉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39218,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"采桑子 其二","author":"黄燮清","text":"去年此刻曾相见，略诉殷勤。\n略解温存。\n略有思量未当真。\n今年此刻重相见，瘦了眉痕。\n肥了愁根。\n难道秋来例病人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39219,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卜算子 其一 由南昌至安庆江行杂咏","author":"黄燮清","text":"湿翠满西山，春水生南浦。\n楼阁何曾管离别，人自匆匆去。\n暮色暝高城，回首成烟雨。\n惟有帆樯不解愁，只等风吹渡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39220,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卜算子 其二 由南昌至安庆江行杂咏","author":"黄燮清","text":"寒重鹧鸪天，春老蘼芜国。\n一日思家是几回，早晚潮和汐。\n且作少文游，高卧篷窗寂。\n万树垂杨梦里过，懒看伤心碧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39221,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卜算子 其三 由南昌至安庆江行杂咏","author":"黄燮清","text":"树隔豫章深，天合鄱阳净。\n水鸟咿哑作橹声，飞入苍烟暝。\n略放嫩阴开，微见斜阳醒。\n远浦轻帆似泪痕，细点冰奁影。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39222,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卜算子 其四 由南昌至安庆江行杂咏","author":"黄燮清","text":"塔影指南康，绕郭烟恋润。\n一段红墙是郡楼，万绿濛濛衬。\n人在画屏风，路展新诗本。\n但抱庐山曲折行，何必烟帆顺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39223,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卜算子 其五 由南昌至安庆江行杂咏","author":"黄燮清","text":"日落大姑山，春满女儿港。\n酒醒微闻叠鼓声，断续吴姬唱。\n远树剪牛毛，古岸排乌榜。\n万点明珠水底红，烟市灯初上。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39224,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"卜算子 其六 由南昌至安庆江行杂咏","author":"黄燮清","text":"家远梦难成，漏静灯无语。\n一夜潇潇淅淅声，五老峰前雨。\n霁影荡澄鲜，山翠开眉宇。\n春色三分已二分，绿满浔阳树。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39225,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望江南 其一 秦邮有赠","author":"王士禛","text":"江南好，风日近秦邮。\n银甲暂停朱阁午，玉笙才度碧云秋。\n扶醉且淹留。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39226,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望江南 其二 秦邮有赠","author":"王士禛","text":"江南好，春暮雨帘纤。\n鱼子天晴初出水，鼠姑风细不钩帘。\n底事恼江淹。\n（案《倚声初集》","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39227,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望江南 其三 秦邮有赠","author":"王士禛","text":"江南好，最好是盂湖。\n何处情人名碧玉，谁家亭子号真珠。\n聊为结相于。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39228,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望江南 其四 秦邮有赠","author":"王士禛","text":"江南好，画舫听吴歌。\n万树垂杨青似黛，一湾春水碧于罗。\n懊恼是横波。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39229,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望江南 其五 秦邮有赠","author":"王士禛","text":"江南好，又过落华朝。\n玉茗歌残情历历，金堂人散水迢迢。\n魂去不须招。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39230,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柳枝 其一 本意","author":"王士禛","text":"鸳鸯湖上水漪漪。\n黄入东风柳渐垂。\n湖里鸳鸯湖畔柳，送侬归处足侬思。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39231,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柳枝 其二 本意","author":"王士禛","text":"二月江头见柳条，千丝万缕映春潮。\n销魂桥上销魂树，不到飞花魂亦销。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39232,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柳枝 其三 赵北口柳枝词","author":"王士禛","text":"湖光如镜复如酥。\n柳色迢迢入大沽。\n亭午银鱼风渐小，一帆春水到蠡吾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39233,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柳枝 其四 赵北口柳枝词","author":"王士禛","text":"楼船彷佛小江南。\n才剪溪藤蜀罽帆。\n飞花相送向何处，柳外官桥黄布帘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39234,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柳枝 其五 赵北口柳枝词","author":"王士禛","text":"湖外垂杨湖上茭。\n夜来春水欲齐梢。\n波浮碧藻金鱼尾，风堕红翎玉剪巢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39235,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"竹枝 其一 东粤竹枝词","author":"王士禛","text":"珠娘十五嫁珠儿。\n住近珠江江水湄。\n江水有情还照妾，江花无计可留伊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39236,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"竹枝 其二 东粤竹枝词","author":"王士禛","text":"沉香浦上花如雪，玉镜台边人似霞。\n醉下兰舟驮细马，不知今夜宿谁家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39237,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"竹枝 其三 东粤竹枝词","author":"王士禛","text":"零丁洋里布帆行。\n别后春潮带雪生。\n昨日高楼望晴色，素馨花满五羊城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39238,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南乡子 夏词","author":"王士禛","text":"菱刺绿，藕花香。\n小姑相唤出横塘。\n隔浦少年私致语。\n忘归去。\n日暮水寒飞属玉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39239,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如梦令 其一 春昼","author":"王士禛","text":"帘外游丝片片。\n昼静碧虚常卷。\n翠雀下花阴，啄破春痕一线。\n谁见。\n谁见。\n清泪朝朝洗面。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39240,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如梦令 其二 和漱玉词","author":"王士禛","text":"送别西楼将暮。\n望断王孙归路。\n昨夜梦郎归，还是旧时别处。\n前渡。\n前渡。\n记得柳丝春鹭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39241,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如梦令 其三 和漱玉词","author":"王士禛","text":"帘额落花风骤。\n春思慵如中酒。\n久待不归来，解说相思如旧。\n堪否。\n堪否。\n坐尽宝炉香瘦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39242,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"如梦令 其四 题叶欣画汉宫秋晚","author":"王士禛","text":"道是江潭小苑。\n又是披香宫殿。\n莲叶悴金塘，何处羊车凤辇。\n秋晚。\n秋晚。\n有个人悲纨扇。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39243,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇 其一 春词和李清照韵","author":"王士禛","text":"水满春塘，柳绵又蘸黄金缕。\n燕儿来去。\n阵阵梨花雨。\n情似黄丝，历乱难成绪。\n凝眸处。\n白蘋青草，不见西洲路。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39244,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇 其二 怀程村游西湖","author":"王士禛","text":"淼淼西陵，闻君南去寻苏小。\n六桥春晓。\n处处游丝绕。\n回首临安，往事伤怀抱。\n空春草。\n吴歈清妙。\n且把金樽倒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39245,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 其一 春闺","author":"王士禛","text":"柳暖花寒雨似酥。\n流莺和梦觉来无。\n东风料峭捲虾须。\n欲觅潇湘屏上路。\n楚山如黛少双鱼。\n口脂慵点镜中朱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39246,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 其二 春闺","author":"王士禛","text":"小院蘼芜欲作丛。\n秋千池畔画堂东。\n日斜莺啭谢娘慵。\n情思泥人何处去，碧桐阴里下帘拢。\n玉钗微堕髻鬟松。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39247,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 其三 春闺","author":"王士禛","text":"宝马流苏上洛津。\n玉人相见宋家邻。\n重重屈戌掩残春。\n檀晕乍消星的浅，眉痕初淡月棱新。\n帘衣如縠映横陈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39248,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 其四 和张泌韵","author":"王士禛","text":"记得相逢亚字城。\n留仙裙底步莲轻。\n吴家小女字盈盈。\n眉语似通还匿笑，目成难去且徐行。\n个侬无赖可怜生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39249,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 其五 和张泌韵","author":"王士禛","text":"雨后虫丝骨碧纱。\n朝来鹊语斗檐牙。\n日痕红曙一栏花。\n残梦未遥犹眷恋，篆烟初袅半天斜。\n消魂应忆泰娘家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39250,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 其六 和漱玉词","author":"王士禛","text":"花影钩帘幂䍥垂。\n红蕤人梦到天涯。\n晚风隔院响添梯。\n画阁久閒金屈膝，平芜何处锦幛泥。\n烦他谢豹客边啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39251,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 其七 和漱玉词","author":"王士禛","text":"奁畔豪犀间玉梳。\n新妆才罢晓寒初。\n曲栏花日影扶疏。\n金鸭暖香消桂蠹，夜蝉轻翅上桃苏。\n问郎曾解画眉无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39252,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 其八 和漱玉词","author":"王士禛","text":"渐次红潮趁靥开。\n木瓜香粉印桃腮。\n为郎瞥见被郎猜。\n不逐晨风飘陌路，愿随明月入君怀。\n半床亸梦待郎来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39253,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 其九 夜行即事","author":"王士禛","text":"灼灼红兰映柁楼。\n娟娟珠露散汀洲。\n湘灵鼓瑟夜深游。\n万点水萤光不定，一滩凉月皓争流。\n白银湾上数鸿秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39254,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 其十 题余氏女子绣浣纱图","author":"王士禛","text":"何处青山是若耶。\n苧萝村畔认西家。\n满溪花瓣浣春纱。\n未入吴宫犹淡漠，一辞乌喙便夭斜。\n针神十五鬓堆鸦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39255,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 其十一 红桥同箨庵茶村伯玑其年和岩赋","author":"王士禛","text":"北郭清溪一带流。\n红桥风物眼中秋。\n绿杨城郭是扬州。\n西望雷塘何处是，香魂零落使人愁。\n澹烟芳草旧迷楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39256,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 其十二 红桥同箨庵茶村伯玑其年和岩赋","author":"王士禛","text":"白鸟朱荷引画桡。\n垂杨影里见红桥。\n欲寻往事已魂销。\n遥指平山山外路，断鸿无数水迢迢。\n新愁分付广陵潮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39257,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"浣溪纱 其十三 红桥同箨庵茶村伯玑其年和岩赋","author":"王士禛","text":"绿树横塘第几家。\n曲阑干外卓金车。\n渠侬独浣越溪纱。\n浦口雨来虹断续，桥边人醉月横斜。\n棹歌声里采菱花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39258,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 其一 和飞卿","author":"王士禛","text":"梦残鬓枣垂香枕。\n夫容髻堕蒲桃锦。\n翠幄碧如烟。\n小星将曙天。\n起来双黛浅。\n绣阁抛金剪。\n憔悴鼠姑红。\n玉阶三月风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39259,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 其二 有赠","author":"王士禛","text":"断红双靥眉如黛。\n清晨小立阑干外。\n映柱送横波。\n教人无奈何。\n漫言常见面。\n似隔蓬山远。\n撩鬓道悤悤。\n春愁知为侬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39260,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮 咏青溪遗事画册同羡门程村其年 其一 乍遇","author":"王士禛","text":"东风人柳三眠起。\n秋千小院重门里。\n对对浴红衣。\n鸳鸯塘上飞。\n个人花底见。\n惊喜回团扇。\n含笑指鸳鸯。\n花时日日双。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39261,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮弈棋 其四","author":"王士禛","text":"曲阑干外红兰吐。\n绿窗人静闻鹦鹉。\n两两赌围棋。\n沉吟金钏迟。\n郎誇中正手。\n向姊偏多口。\n解意小猧儿。\n恼人将负时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39262,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮弈棋私语 其五","author":"王士禛","text":"梧桐花落飞香雪。\n卷帘一片玲珑月。\n人月两婵娟。\n倚阑凭玉肩。\n小鬟春睡倦。\n裙上苔花茜。\n私语好谁闻。\n垣娥应羡人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39263,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮弈棋私语迷藏 其六","author":"王士禛","text":"玉兰花发清明近。\n花间小蝶黏香鬓。\n邀伴捉迷藏。\n露微花气凉。\n花深防暗逻。\n潜向花阴躲。\n蝉翼惹花枝。\n背人扶鬓丝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39264,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮弈棋私语迷藏弹琴 其七","author":"王士禛","text":"玲珑嵌石红蕉叶。\n蕉阴宝鸭香初爇。\n独整素琴弹。\n琴清玉手寒。\n声声珠作串。\n弹出湘君怨。\n今夜梦潇湘。\n琴心秋水长。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39265,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮弈棋私语迷藏弹琴读书 其八","author":"王士禛","text":"帘衣半掩湘妃竹。\n洞房今夜摊书读。\n懊恼画屏人。\n铜壶清漏频。\n潜藏郎背面。\n作剧桃枝扇。\n鹦鹉唤回头。\n低鬟笑不休。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39266,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮弈棋私语迷藏弹琴读书潜窥 其九","author":"王士禛","text":"双双玉兔衣如雪。\n中庭桂树县明月。\n也解逐雄雌。\n倚帘含笑窥。\n幽踪郎见惯。\n潜向银屏看。\n娇靥晕红潮。\n佯羞妥翠翘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39267,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮弈棋私语迷藏弹琴读书潜窥秘戏 其十","author":"王士禛","text":"蝉纱十幅围红玉。\n龟纹枕畔双鬟绿。\n银蒜镇垂垂。\n含羞忍笑时。\n屏山金屈戌。\n女伴偷相觑。\n明日画堂中。\n须防面发红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39268,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菩萨蛮弈棋私语迷藏弹琴读书潜窥秘戏 其十一 回文","author":"王士禛","text":"镜台移日朝红映。\n映红朝日移台镜。\n人玉照秾春。\n春秾照玉人。\n幕垂寒略略。\n略略寒垂幕。\n花晓衬窗纱。\n纱窗衬晓花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":39269,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]